**Lessons:** (1) Verify data assumptions (e.g. “IDs unique per tenant”) with real queries before stating as fact. (2) Cluster size can mask inefficiency (same plan runs faster on LARGE than X_SMALL); optimize the plan, not only the cluster. (3) For JIRA description updates via API, pass markdown string; the tool converts to ADF.